  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">玩家動畫模組</a>的擴充套件，可使其適用於人形生物。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">與玩家動畫模組相同，它屬於函式庫模組，本身不具獨立功能。主要為<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-mob-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的生物戰鬥</a>模組而開發。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">相容於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\">守衛村民</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體模型特性</a>模組。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">本模組透過設定選項修復了玩家動畫模組與實體模型特性模組間現有的相容性問題。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">內含名為「is_playeranimator_animation_active」的實體模型特性變數，可供CEM資源包使用。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
